[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4218.83, "timestamp": "01:10:18", "text": "此前，在 Helios 發射期間，靠近運米機"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4221.669, "timestamp": "01:10:21", "text": "虛空物質濃度異常高。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4225.39, "timestamp": "01:10:25", "text": "這給發射造成了問題。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4229.11, "timestamp": "01:10:29", "text": "原因不明，但茂木教授把它帶回來了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4233.03, "timestamp": "01:10:33", "text": "我把它和該設備的某個變體進行比較後就明白了。 WHO"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4237.35, "timestamp": "01:10:37", "text": "這是人為造成的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4248.229, "timestamp": "01:10:48", "text": "赫爾森教授，我真的什麼都不記得了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4255.75, "timestamp": "01:10:55", "text": "沒必要這麼緊張。盧西勒教授"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4258.83, "timestamp": "01:10:58", "text": "我聽說他已被洗清嫌疑。"}]